{"path":"container/priority_queue/emplace","title":"std::priority_queue<T,Container,Compare>::emplace","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::priority_queue&lt;T,Container,Compare&gt;::</span>emplace","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/priority_queue/emplace","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Pushes a new element to the priority queue. The element is constructed in-place, i.e. no copy or move operations are performed.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> emplace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Pushes a new element to the priority queue. The element is constructed in-place, i.e. no copy or move operations are performed. The constructor of the element is called with exactly the same arguments as supplied to the function.\n</p>\nEffectively calls <pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>c.<span class=\"me1\">emplace_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/push_heap\"><span class=\"kw1649\">std::<span class=\"me2\">push_heap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, c.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, comp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> arguments to forward to the constructor of the element\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Logarithmic number of comparisons plus the complexity of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Container<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">emplace_back</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;queue&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> S\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> id<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    S<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> id<span class=\"br0\">{</span>i<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"S::S(\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>);<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>S <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x, S <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">id</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">id</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/priority_queue\"><span class=\"kw1307\">std::<span class=\"me2\">priority_queue</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>S<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> queue<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    queue.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">3.14</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"C++\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"id: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> queue.<span class=\"me1\">top</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">id</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>S::S(42, 3.14, \"C++\")\nid = 42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/priority_queue/push\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts element and sorts the underlying container <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/priority_queue/pop\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pop</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes the top element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/priority_queue","title":"std::priority_queue"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::priority_queue<T,Container,Compare>::emplace","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Pushes a new element to the priority queue."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Logarithmic number of comparisons plus the complexity of Container::emplace_back."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push","note":"inserts element and sorts the underlying container"},{"label":"pop","note":"removes the top element"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":177,"codeBlockCount":3}
